Spec: Portable bounded wire JSON facade

Purpose:
  Share strict decoding and lexical integer validation between platform control and authenticated transport adapters.

Owns:
  ./WireJson.java

References:
  ./StrictJson.sdd

Must:
  Preserve duplicate-key, UTF-8, depth, value-count and byte limits of the existing decoder.
  Validate field sets and integer lexical form explicitly without coercion or raw exception disclosure.
  Expose original formal connection params only after validating the control request; nested policy limits apply to original bytes.
